        <h2 id="header-example" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
          Example HTTP response headers
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
          A response starts with a status line, followed by named fields and
          their values. The exact set varies by website, route and request.
        </p>
      </div>

      <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6 text-sm leading-7"><code>HTTP/2 200 OK
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
Content-Encoding: br
